/**

@brief Die-to-die (D2D) tests
@defgroup tests_d2d D2D
@ingroup all_tests
@details
Die-to-die links between chips in a package. The tests cover loading the link firmware
into each D2D tile, and bringing the links up between dies. The load tests run on one
tile at a time. The training test brings up every link that faces another die.
@{
@}

*/

/**

@brief D2D firmware load tests
@defgroup tests_d2d_load D2D firmware load
@ingroup tests_d2d
@details
Loading the D2D link firmware into a tile's SRAM. The tests check the copied bytes, the
configuration block the loader writes, and that the core stays halted until it is
started, then runs the firmware.
@{
@}

*/

/**

@brief D2D link training tests
@defgroup tests_d2d_train D2D link training
@ingroup tests_d2d
@details
Bringing up the links between dies. The test loads the firmware into every tile that
faces another die, releases the cores, and waits for each link to train.
@{
@}

*/
